WEBVTT

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:12.167
Receipts: n8n orchestrates, the helper API does the work

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:13.200
Receipts: running in replay, no key and no spend

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:19.733
30 receipts extracted, then reconciled against the bank file

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.867
The reconciled spreadsheet: mismatches flagged first

00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:29.900
The summary email lands in Mailpit

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:38.267
Inbox: every email is triaged, drafts wait for a person

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:39.833
Inbox: running in replay, no key and no spend

00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:47.033
Injection attempts take the held branch and are never drafted

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:52.267
Three injection emails quarantined, with the evidence

00:00:52.267 --> 00:00:57.067
Drafted replies wait on the approver page. Nothing is sent yet

00:00:57.067 --> 00:01:06.033
A person approves one draft, and exactly that text is sent

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:10.067
The approved reply arrives in Mailpit

00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:16.633
Leads: company names in, researched CRM records out

00:01:16.633 --> 00:01:16.900
Leads: running in replay, no key and no spend

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:22.733
17 companies researched, 3 reported as having no website

00:01:22.733 --> 00:01:30.367
Every CRM field carries the quoted text and source it came from

00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:33.300
The summary email: added, updated, no website
